// Asserted to stay OPEN by RulesTest#unsoundWfProblemStaysOpen: a dynamic node does not
// conform to a fixed-size type, even with the right length, because conformsFixedIsFixed reads
// fixed(st) off the atom. conformsFixedRight must owe fixed(st).

\problem {
    conforms(emptyOf<[int[0]]>, emptyOf<[int[]]>)
}
